    <string name="about_changelog">Changelog:
&#8226; Full-background remote server + QR code (URL shown on home screen)
&#8226; Remote server PIN + login page
&#8226; Configurable remote server port
&#8226; Upload files from a browser on another device to device storage
&#8226; List filters in the app and remote page (Active/Done/Failed)
&#8226; Gallery with Photo/Video filter + file size and date
&#8226; Open-folder button for finished downloads
&#8226; Video quality picker for m3u8 (HLS) playlists
&#8226; Automatic "unduhan_date_time" filename when the server sends no name
&#8226; Auto-move finished files to Video/Photo subfolders (setting)
&#8226; Pause all / Resume all / Retry failed buttons
&#8226; Automatic retry with gradual backoff (5s &#8594; 10s &#8594; 20s &#8594; &#8230;)
&#8226; Sort list (date, name, size, status)
&#8226; Parallel multi-segment downloads (segment count configurable)
&#8226; Battery and storage status on the remote page
&#8226; Recent URL history with quick search
&#8226; Per-download speed limit and priority
&#8226; Stream and download files via remote browser
&#8226; MD5/SHA1/SHA256 checksum verification
&#8226; Full-storage detection + automatic .part cleanup
&#8226; Crash logger ("Log error" button on the remote page)
&#8226; Remote file manager: browse folders, upload, download, rename, move &amp; delete files
&#8226; Upload multiple files at once with progress &amp; speed
&#8226; Download folders as ZIP in the file manager
&#8226; Multi-select mode (bulk delete/move) in the file manager
&#8226; Search &amp; sort files in the file manager
&#8226; Dark mode for the remote page
&#8226; Real-time download speed graph
&#8226; Upload streams directly to the destination folder (saves RAM &amp; cache space)</string>
